## Testing

- `cargo check -p warp` passes.
- Manually tested with `./script/run`:
1. Settings > Features > Tab key behavior: Select "Open completions
menu". The dropdown shows "Open completions menu" and the hint line
shows "→ accepts autosuggestions.".
2. Select "Accept autosuggestion". The hint line shows "Ctrl Space opens
completion menu.".
3. Switch to another settings page and back. The dropdown still shows
"Accept autosuggestion".
4. Settings > Keyboard shortcuts: Select "Accept Autosuggestion", change
to any key except Tab (e.g. "Ctrl Shift Space"). Switch back to Settings
> Features. The dropdown now shows "User defined" and the hint line is
hided.

- [x] I have manually tested my changes locally with `./script/run`

